Packages digitalcredential, digitalcredential/internal/safehttp and
digitalcredential/statuslist are written from scratch.

Test vectors in the statuslist tests and testdata are copied from
draft-ietf-oauth-status-list-21 (§4.2 and Appendix C).

Third-party code: none is copied into this module. It depends on module
github.com/pilacorp/go-credential-sdk/jose of this repository, and through it
on github.com/decred/dcrd/dcrec/secp256k1/v4 (ISC License).
